      <title>Top 8 Methods to Parse YAML Files in Python</title>
      <link>https://sqlpey.com/python/top-8-methods-to-parse-yaml-files-in-python/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 15 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sqlpey.com/python/top-8-methods-to-parse-yaml-files-in-python/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;top-8-methods-to-parse-yaml-files-in-python&#34;&gt;Top 8 Methods to Parse YAML Files in Python&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;YAML (YAML Ain&amp;rsquo;t Markup Language) is often used in configuration files and data interaction between languages. If you&amp;rsquo;re working with YAML in Python, there are multiple libraries and methods to effectively parse YAML files. Here, we dive into eight robust solutions that illustrate how to read, write, and manipulate YAML content in your Python applications.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;method-1-reading-and-writing-yaml-files-with-pyyaml&#34;&gt;Method 1: Reading and Writing YAML Files with PyYAML&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;## -*- coding: utf-8 -*-&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; yaml&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; io&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;## Define data structure for YAML&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;data &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;a list&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: [&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;42&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;3.141&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1337&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;help&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;€&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ],&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;a string&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;bla&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;,&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;another dict&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;foo&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;bar&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;,&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;key&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;value&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;,&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;the answer&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;42&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    }&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;## Writing to YAML file&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; io&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;open(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;data.yaml&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;w&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, encoding&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;utf8&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; outfile:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    yaml&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;dump(data, outfile, default_flow_style&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;False&lt;/span&gt;, allow_unicode&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;## Reading from YAML file&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; open(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;data.yaml&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;r&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; stream:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    data_loaded &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; yaml&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;safe_load(stream)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;## Checking if data is identical&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;print(data &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; data_loaded)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This method uses the PyYAML library, which is straightforward for writing and reading YAML files.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
